     "campaign",
     "loss very different between the paths (0.88% on the MEC path against 2.27% on the remote path). Only COMPLETE frames become latency samples, so the path that loses more drops exactly the samples of the instants with a full queue and looks better than it is. The comparison of this execution does not hold."
